# AI-driven spec review flow (template)

1. **Feature spec in its own directory** — e.g. `specs/00N-*/` with `spec.md`, `plan.md`, `research.md` as needed. Do not rewrite older `00M` specs; add a new feature for new work.
2. **One PR per repository** — scope: spec/docs only (or clearly separated commits). Title: `docs(spec): …` with Conventional Commits.
3. **PR body** — link sibling specs in other repos, list reviewers (maintainers + supply-chain), note “spec review only / no runtime change” when true.
4. **After merge** — bump pins or implementation in follow-up PRs, not in the spec PR.

